{
  "sn22.79:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 22.79 ",
  "sn22.79:0.2": "8. Khajjanīyavagga ",
  "sn22.79:0.3": "Khajjanīyasutta ",
  "sn22.79:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn22.79:1.2": "“Ye hi keci, bhikkhave, samaṇā vā brāhmaṇā vā anekavihitaṁ pubbenivāsaṁ anussaramānā anussaranti sabbete pañcupādānakkhandhe anussaranti etesaṁ vā aññataraṁ. ",
  "sn22.79:1.3": "Katame pañca? ",
  "sn22.79:1.4": "‘Evaṁrūpo ahosiṁ atītamaddhānan’ti—",
  "sn22.79:1.5": "iti vā hi, bhikkhave, anussaramāno rūpaṁyeva anussarati. ",
  "sn22.79:1.6": "‘Evaṁvedano ahosiṁ atītamaddhānan’ti—",
  "sn22.79:1.7": "iti vā hi, bhikkhave, anussaramāno vedanaṁyeva anussarati. ",
  "sn22.79:1.8": "‘Evaṁsañño ahosiṁ atītamaddhānan’ti … ",
  "sn22.79:1.9": "‘evaṁsaṅkhāro ahosiṁ atītamaddhānan’ti … ",
  "sn22.79:1.10": "‘evaṁviññāṇo ahosiṁ atītamaddhānan’ti—",
  "sn22.79:1.11": "iti vā hi, bhikkhave, anussaramāno viññāṇameva anussarati. ",
  "sn22.79:2.1": "Kiñca, bhikkhave, rūpaṁ vadetha? ",
  "sn22.79:2.2": "Ruppatīti kho, bhikkhave, tasmā ‘rūpan’ti vuccati. ",
  "sn22.79:2.3": "Kena ruppati? ",
  "sn22.79:2.4": "Sītenapi ruppati, uṇhenapi ruppati, jighacchāyapi ruppati, pipāsāyapi ruppati, ḍaṁsamakasavātātapasarīsapasamphassenapi ruppati. ",
  "sn22.79:2.5": "Ruppatīti kho, bhikkhave, tasmā ‘rūpan’ti vuccati. ",
  "sn22.79:3.1": "Kiñca, bhikkhave, vedanaṁ vadetha? ",
  "sn22.79:3.2": "Vedayatīti 